      },
      "summary": {
        "nb": "St. Hanshaugen er en park i Oslo. «St. Hanshaugen» brukes også om bydel St. Hanshaugen og strøket St. Hanshaugen.",
        "en": "St. Hanshaugen Park is a large public park located just north of the city center of Oslo, Norway. It is a classic urban park located within the borough of St. Hanshaugen, which was named for the park which lies within its center. St. Hanshaugen Park is situated between Geitmyrsveien, Colletts gate, Ullevålsveien and Knud Knudsens plass. Nearby are Bislett Stadium and Alexander Kiellands plass.\n"
